    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or weight loss; weight rising</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No sinus pain or discharge</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>Occasional palpitations, less often than in the spring; no chest pain or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Morning cough with about a tablespoon of sputum; no blood since the first month; breathless on the second flight of stairs</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Stools firm every two days on morphine; no abdominal pain</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Regular periods; no urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild upper back ache at the end of a long day of writing, as for many years; no new pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No rashes or changing moles</td></tr><tr><td>Breast</td><td>Negative</td><td>No lump, pain or nipple discharge</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No drowsiness, headaches or weakness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood better; no thoughts of self-harm; PHQ-2 1</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

