    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with her consent. She wants full treatment of any chest infection or bleeding, including hospital care, and would want her poems and papers kept safe if she were ever too ill to manage them. She named a health care agent, recorded in the confidential part of the chart and not named here, and chose not to record other treatment preferences today. To be revisited yearly. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
